              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato tagh kïchenga ewungu kikompe tökïgha, ilenchï kolan ante nyo ochï ECHOTYON Kimuktoghin, ‘Aghegha lenyini kamwaghan! ",
          "type": "text",
