              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arosakwa! Opchinan meghat kanasyantanï kïkurtegho kaynenyan. Olentekwa so kïchïwïtyot monyorï sitenyan? Ompöwölo omitan opu ngot nyo wongöy pipö ngwïny löwïr!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
